      "Rev. Mikhail Mikhail, Class of 2016"
    ]
  },
  "summary": {
    "en": [
      "Rev. Mikhail Mikhail carried Coptic Orthodox theological training from Cairo into decades of ministry and education in the United States. Ordained in 1974, he helped establish Coptic Orthodox theological education in America and served Cleveland as a priest, teacher, dean, and pastoral leader rooted in Egyptian heritage and faith."
    ]
